{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16613","headline":"奉酬韦使君送归山之作 · 丘丹","name":"奉酬韦使君送归山之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侧闻郡守至，偶乘黄犊出。\n不别桃源人，一见经累日。\n蝉鸣念秋稼，兰酌动离瑟。\n临水降麾幢，野艇才容膝。\n参差碧山路，目送江帆疾。\n涉海得骊珠，栖梧惭凤质。\n媿非郑公里，归扫蒙笼室。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丘丹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}